Star vamps are much stronger, a lot more versatile than non-stars, so cards like Pentex SHOULD exist... Indeed it creates so many opportunities to dismantle methuselahs and/or oust them, but it is manageable. Couple of scenerios are introduced here by the others, I'd like to add the concept of influecing multiple vamps at once or using support vamps who can play Stealth or any cards that help you to remove Pentex.

